(6872103, 1034560, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous!  I hope this wins a ribbon.  Riley did an awesome job with the expression.  This is my fave of the challenge because it really catches the sentiment of Rockwell and the processing is spot on.</td>', 'This is fabulous!  I hope this wins a ribbon.  Riley did an awesome job with the expression.  This is my fave of the challenge because it really catches the sentiment of Rockwell and the processing is spot on.', '2012-09-30 23:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
