(6872109, 1034692, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Rockwell shot to me.  Full of so many fun little elements.  That dog is adorable!</td>', 'This looks like a Rockwell shot to me.  Full of so many fun little elements.  That dog is adorable!', '2012-09-30 23:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
