(6872114, 1034352, 67697, '<td valign="top">Like Norman Rockwell goes to the dark side.  Interesting life moment.  Hope the wheel chair is a temporary thing.</td>', 'Like Norman Rockwell goes to the dark side.  Interesting life moment.  Hope the wheel chair is a temporary thing.', '2012-09-30 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6872115, 1034237, 67697, '<td valign="top">That look is cute and priceless.  So sweet.</td>', 'That look is cute and priceless.  So sweet.', '2012-09-30 23:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6872116, 1034694, 83313, '<td valign="top">I had to think for a moment as to what Rockwell piece this was emulating. Nice take on the challenge. All the stickie notes are a nice touch. Despite all the technology, we still rely on old fashioned paper.</td>', 'I had to think for a moment as to what Rockwell piece this was emulating. Nice take on the challenge. All the stickie notes are a nice touch. Despite all the technology, we still rely on old fashioned paper.', '2012-09-30 23:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6872118, 1034720, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very nice environmental portrait, though I''m not feeling a lot of the Rockellian touch in it. Not regarding the visual look, but rather the bit of a humorous twist his paintings always seem to have. But I didn''t enter this challenge, so you still did better than I did!</td>', 'A very nice environmental portrait, though I''m not feeling a lot of the Rockellian touch in it. Not regarding the visual look, but rather the bit of a humorous twist his paintings always seem to have. But I didn''t enter this challenge, so you still did better than I did!', '2012-09-30 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6872119, 1034531, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice street photography, but it doesn''t seem to have a Rockwell feel in either processing or the bit of a humorous twist his images always have.</td>', 'Nice street photography, but it doesn''t seem to have a Rockwell feel in either processing or the bit of a humorous twist his images always have.', '2012-09-30 23:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6872120, 1034560, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice modern take on the Rockwell approach. Both in processing and in a humorous twist to the scene.</td>', 'A nice modern take on the Rockwell approach. Both in processing and in a humorous twist to the scene.', '2012-09-30 23:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6872121, 1034660, 83313, '<td valign="top">I recognize a Jenn original when I see it. Did you trade one of your girls in for a boy?</td>', 'I recognize a Jenn original when I see it. Did you trade one of your girls in for a boy?', '2012-09-30 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6872125, 1034582, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bumping this one up from a 5 to a 7 on the second pass. Not because of the actual photography, but because you captured what I felt is lacking from most of the entries in this challenge. The bit of a humorous twist his images always have. Everybody is applauding this girl''s performance except for the bratty brother who is making faces in the corner and hiding his laughter.</td>', 'Bumping this one up from a 5 to a 7 on the second pass. Not because of the actual photography, but because you captured what I felt is lacking from most of the entries in this challenge. The bit of a humorous twist his images always have. Everybody is applauding this girl''s performance except for the bratty brother who is making faces in the corner and hiding his laughter.', '2012-09-30 23:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6872129, 1034560, 121949, '<td valign="top">When I saw this I thought dang!! I think you are going to give me a run for my money. It will be fun to see who comes out on top. If I was a betting girl I think I would put my money on this one for the blue.</td>', 'When I saw this I thought dang!! I think you are going to give me a run for my money. It will be fun to see who comes out on top. If I was a betting girl I think I would put my money on this one for the blue.', '2012-09-30 23:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
