(6872642, 1034646, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the "drawn and sketched" quality. I also like the vision, the twist rather than literal take on the image. (I also like this image because, at times, I believe thought and theme get sacrificed for a "pop art" sort of technique-driven image ideal.) Its not a pretty image, but it has the brown on black graphic feel of late 70''s album cover.</td>', 'I like the "drawn and sketched" quality. I also like the vision, the twist rather than literal take on the image. (I also like this image because, at times, I believe thought and theme get sacrificed for a "pop art" sort of technique-driven image ideal.) Its not a pretty image, but it has the brown on black graphic feel of late 70''s album cover.', '2012-10-01 09:38:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6872648, 1034352, 12611, '<td valign="top">The blur and bursts of light are in all the right spots.</td>', 'The blur and bursts of light are in all the right spots.', '2012-10-01 09:40:13.000000', NULL, 0),
